      {
        "rule": "`package_revision_head`固定为`INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 CHECK(package_revision_head >= 0)`，Run Admission初值0，每次Promotion以expected数值CAS后加1，禁止物化为TEXT或从时间戳推导。Admission固定`recovery_attempt_ordinal=0`且其余recovery/freshness列为NULL"
      }
    ],
